id: mafuba
name: Mafuba
restriction: true
reduction: 5
locked: Weapon Seal
# Its Life Points paid as Sealing is used; a Natural 1 on the Might Clash destroys the container.
sealMafuba: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Sealing costs 5x the target's Might in Life Points, won or not; a Natural 1 on its Might Clash destroys the container.
text: >
  Mafuba: Your sealing technique drains on your own life force to use.
  –Locked Advancements: Weapon Seal
  –TP Cost: -5
  –Effect: When you use the Sealing Maneuver, if you succeed or not, reduce your Life Points by 5x the Might of the target.
  If you score a Natural Result of 1 on the Might Clash, destroy the container.
